# Chiitoitsu forbids 4-of-a-kind as two pairs and scores fixed 25 fu even on tsumo
# (rules.md §1 chiitoitsu_25_fu, §3.1, §4 item 10).
# Part 1: Seat 1 holds 2222m 44m 66p 88p 33s 7s and draws 7s (5 distinct pairs + 4-of-a-kind 2222m).
#   Because 2222m cannot be two pairs in Chiitoitsu, the hand is NOT complete ->
#   assert_illegal 1: tsumo, assert_illegal 1: riichi! Seat 1 tsumogiris 7s.
# Part 2: After one cycle (so no Chiihou), Seat 2 holds 11m 99m 11p 99p 22s 55z 9s and draws 9s ->
#   Chiitoitsu + Menzen Tsumo = 3 han FIXED 25 fu (NOT rounded up to 30 fu)!
#   Non-dealer 3 han 25 fu tsumo = 800 / 1600 (+3200; 30 fu would be 1000 / 2000).

[meta]
name: chiitoitsu_25_fu_no_four_of_a_kind
title: Chiitoitsu rejects four-of-a-kind as two pairs and scores fixed 25 fu on tsumo
rules: mahjongsoul
source: rules.md §1, §3.1, §4.10

[round]
