hand 1: 2222m 44m 66p 88p 33s 7s
hand 2: 1199m 1199p 22s 55z 9s
hand 3: 369m 37p 468s 23467z
dora: 1z
draws: 4z 7s 6z 7z 3z 4z 9s

[steps]
