assert_illegal 1: tsumo
assert_illegal 1: riichi
1 tsumogiri 7s
2 tsumogiri 6z
3 tsumogiri 7z
0 tsumogiri 3z
1 tsumogiri 4z
assert_legal 2: tsumo
2 tsumo

